[2026-08-02T17:01:33.802Z] [INFO]           "+      # actually attempted; keep it when a real NPM_TOKEN bootstrap secret exists.",
[2026-08-02T17:01:33.802Z] [INFO]           "+      # See actions/setup-node#1551 and issue #191.",
[2026-08-02T17:01:33.802Z] [INFO]           "+      - name: Prepare npm authentication",
