[2026-08-02T17:05:05.062Z] [INFO]           "command": "cd /tmp/gh-issue-solver-1785689586800 && git add -A && git commit -q -m \"fix(ci): strip setup-node placeholder token so npm OIDC publishing works\n\nactions/setup-node writes //registry.npmjs.org/:_authToken=\\$…KEN}\nand exports the placeholder XXXXX-XXXXX-XXXXX-XXXXX when no token is supplied.\nnpm then treats the run as authenticated, skips the OIDC exchange, and the\nregistry rejects the anonymous PUT with a misleading E404 (see\nactions/setup-node#1551). This has blocked every meta-language npm release\nsince 0.55.0.\n\n- add js/scripts/prepare-npm-auth.mjs to sanitize the npm user config, resolve\n  the auth mode (token/oidc/none), and fail with actionable guidance instead of\n  a bare E404; verbose diagnostics default off (NPM_AUTH_DEBUG=1 or --verbose)\n  and never log credential values\n- wire the script into the publish job, keep an optional NPM_TOKEN bootstrap\n  fallback, and explain publish failures\n- cover the behaviour with tests and update the release workflow assertions\n\nRefs #191\" && git log --oneline -1",
[2026-08-02T17:05:05.062Z] [INFO]           "description": "Commit npm auth fix"
