[2026-08-02T17:08:44.464Z] [INFO]         "type": "tool_result",
[2026-08-02T17:08:44.464Z] [INFO]         "content": "{\"body\":\"<!--- Please direct any generic questions related to actions to our support community forum at https://github.community/c/code-to-cloud/github-actions/41 --->\\n<!--- Before opening up a new feature request, please make sure to check for similar existing issues and pull requests -->\\n\\n**Description:**\\nA lot of packages are switching to OIDC to validate packages when publishing. It took a lot of debugging, but we had to reset the auth token to empty string intentionally in our CI, but it wasn't clear what was setting it.\\n\\nAny chance we can the default setting to support NPM OIDC?\\n\",\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"Don't default NPM_AUTH_TOKEN to support NPM OIDC\"}",
[2026-08-02T17:08:44.464Z] [INFO]         "is_error": false
[2026-08-02T17:08:44.464Z] [INFO]       }
