[2026-08-02T17:11:18.667Z] [INFO]     "content": [
[2026-08-02T17:11:18.667Z] [INFO]       {
[2026-08-02T17:11:18.667Z] [INFO]         "tool_use_id": "toolu_01ELQE52rS6Xh18JwN4R6e83",
[2026-08-02T17:11:18.667Z] [INFO]         "type": "tool_result",
[2026-08-02T17:11:18.667Z] [INFO]         "content": "`scripts/sanitize-npm-userconfig.mjs` removes the deprecated `always-auth` key but\nkeeps the `_authToken` line that `actions/setup-node` writes. When a project has no\n`NPM_TOKEN` secret and relies on OIDC trusted publishing, that leftover line makes\nnpm believe it is already authenticated, so it never performs the OIDC exchange and\nthe registry rejects the anonymous upload with a misleading `E404`.\n...\n`actions/setup-node@v7` fixes the root cause too, but the sanitiser change is\nversion-agnostic and protects projects that are still pinned to `@v6`.\n\nA working implementation, with tests, is in\n`js/scripts/prepare-npm-auth.mjs` of link-foundation/meta-language (PR #192).",
[2026-08-02T17:11:18.667Z] [INFO]         "is_error": false
[2026-08-02T17:11:18.667Z] [INFO]       }
[2026-08-02T17:11:18.667Z] [INFO]     ]
[2026-08-02T17:11:18.667Z] [INFO]   },
[2026-08-02T17:11:18.667Z] [INFO]   "parent_tool_use_id": null,
[2026-08-02T17:11:18.667Z] [INFO]   "session_id": "60d82f4e-0f54-4f28-b583-654914b9294b",
[2026-08-02T17:11:18.667Z] [INFO]   "uuid": "30212c26-ed6b-4f02-a855-3dfff8858ba0",
[2026-08-02T17:11:18.667Z] [INFO]   "timestamp": "2026-08-02T17:11:18.661Z",
[2026-08-02T17:11:18.667Z] [INFO]   "tool_use_result": {
[2026-08-02T17:11:18.667Z] [INFO]     "stdout": "`scripts/sanitize-npm-userconfig.mjs` removes the deprecated `always-auth` key but\nkeeps the `_authToken` line that `actions/setup-node` writes. When a project has no\n`NPM_TOKEN` secret and relies on OIDC trusted publishing, that leftover line makes\nnpm believe it is already authenticated, so it never performs the OIDC exchange and\nthe registry rejects the anonymous upload with a misleading `E404`.\n...\n`actions/setup-node@v7` fixes the root cause too, but the sanitiser change is\nversion-agnostic and protects projects that are still pinned to `@v6`.\n\nA working implementation, with tests, is in\n`js/scripts/prepare-npm-auth.mjs` of link-foundation/meta-language (PR #192).",
[2026-08-02T17:11:18.667Z] [INFO]     "stderr": "",
[2026-08-02T17:11:18.667Z] [INFO]     "interrupted": false,
[2026-08-02T17:11:18.667Z] [INFO]     "isImage": false,
[2026-08-02T17:11:18.667Z] [INFO]     "noOutputExpected": false
[2026-08-02T17:11:18.667Z] [INFO]   }
[2026-08-02T17:11:18.667Z] [INFO] }
