[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           " ---",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           " ",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+## npm Publishing Fails with E404 or ENEEDAUTH",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+### Symptom",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+The `Publish npm Package` job of `.github/workflows/js.yml` fails with either:",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+```",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+npm error code E404",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+npm error 404 Not Found - PUT https://registry.npmjs.org/meta-language",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+```",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+or, on older configurations:",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+```",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+npm error code ENEEDAUTH",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+```",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+The `E404` is misleading: the package exists on the registry and the version is new.",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+npm returns 404 rather than 403 for writes it considers unauthenticated.",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+### Root Cause",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+`actions/setup-node` with `registry-url` unconditionally writes",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+```",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+//registry.npmjs.org/:_authToken=${N…KEN}",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+```",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+into `$NPM_CONFIG_USERCONFIG` and exports the placeholder",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+`NODE_AUTH_TOKEN=XXX…XX` when the workflow supplies no token.",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+npm then treats itself as already authenticated, **skips the OIDC token exchange**",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+required by trusted publishing, and the registry rejects the anonymous upload.",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+With an *empty* token the same line produces `ENEEDAUTH` instead.",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+See [actions/setup-node#1440](https://github.com/actions/setup-node/issues/1440)",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+and [#1551](https://github.com/actions/setup-node/issues/1551). The upstream fix",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+([PR #1558](https://github.com/actions/setup-node/pull/1558)) removed the",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+placeholder, but it shipped only on the **v7** line — `@v6` still exports it.",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+### How This Repository Prevents It",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+The publish job runs `js/scripts/prepare-npm-auth.mjs` between `setup-node` and",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+`npm publish`. The script:",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+1. resolves the auth mode — `token` (a real `NPM_TOKEN`/`NODE_AUTH_TOKEN`),",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+   `oidc` (`ACT…URL` + `ACT…KEN`),",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+   or `none`;",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+2. strips the placeholder `_authToken` line unless a real token is in play, so the",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+   OIDC handshake actually happens, and always strips the deprecated `always-auth`",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+   key that npm 11 warns about;",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+3. **exits non-zero with remediation instructions** when the mode is `none`, so a",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+   missing credential fails loudly instead of surfacing as a bare `E404`.",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+### Solution",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+If the job reports auth mode `oidc` and the publish still fails, the trusted",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+publisher is not configured. On npmjs.com open the package settings and add a",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+trusted publisher for repository `link-foundation/meta-language` with workflow file",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+`.github/workflows/js.yml` — the filename must match exactly. Keep",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+`permissions: id-token: [REDACTED] on the publish job and npm >= 11.5.1.",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+As a bootstrap, before trusted publishing is configured, add an `NPM_TOKEN`",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+repository secret; the workflow passes it as `NODE_AUTH_TOKEN` and the script keeps",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+the credential line in place. The secret can be removed afterwards.",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+### Debugging",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+Verbose credential tracing is off by default. Enable it by setting the repository",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+variable `NPM_AUTH_DEBUG` to `1` (or by running the script with `--verbose`):",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+```bash",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+NPM_AUTH_DEBUG=1 node js/scripts/prepare-npm-auth.mjs",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+```",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+It prints the resolved auth mode, the npm user config path, and the *key names* in",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+that file. Values are never printed, so a real token cannot leak into the log.",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+### Reference",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+- [npm trusted publishers](https://docs.npmjs.com/trusted-publishers)",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+- [Issue #191](https://github.com/link-foundation/meta-language/issues/191) and its",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+  evidence folder `dev/log/issues/191/pulls/192/`",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+---",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           "+",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           " ## Secret Configuration Issues",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           " ",
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]           " ### Required Secrets"
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]         ]
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]       }
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]     ],
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]     "userModified": false,
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]     "replaceAll": false
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO]   }
[2026-08-02T17:12:10.459Z] [INFO] }
